---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
// import Arrow from "../components/Arrow.astro";
const title = "Designing Stories";
---

<Layout>
	<div class="coreContainer animateBG animate page">
		<main class="main">
			<article class="bio">
				<picture class="bio-pic">
					<img src="/images/sergio.jpg" alt="Sergio Acosta" />
				</picture>
				<div class="bio-content">
					<h1>Meet Jesus Acosta</h1>
					<p>
						As a young man, I was one day forced to decide between humanities, arts or computer science. 
						It was a hard dilemma: joining the tech high school or get enrolled in philosphy.
					</p>
					<p>
						In the end, my journey has integrated all those appealling paths.
					</p>
					<p>
						Coding or making art, it all starts with curiosity and a desire for understanding and capturing 
						the meaning of things. Making sense of what happens. That experience. That event. 
						And then give way to the actual crafting of a story, bit by bit.
					</p>
					<p>
						As a developer, I go through this process of investigation with the help of computer languages and design principles. 
						It's HTML, JavaScript, CSS, at time even modern frameworks like Astro or React.
					</p>
					<p>
						Learning code to display stories on screens has been a conscious and joyfull choice.
						It gave me the ability to share my insights in some corners of the web.
					</p>
					<p>
						The front-end is my space.
					</p>
					<p>
						Welcome to <a href="/"><strong>Designing Stories</strong></a>.
					</p>
					<p>
						I develop other people’s stories, and
						<a
							href="https://www.sergioacosta.co.uk/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer"
							title="Sergio Acosta CV"
						>
							{" "}
							other companies’ stories
						</a>
						. And from{" "}
						<a
							href="https://www.danceinconversation.co.uk"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer"
							title="Dance in Conversation"
						>
							time{" "}
						</a>
						to{" "}
						<a
							href="https://www.justgiving.com/fundraising/sergio-acosta"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer"
							title="Swimming"
						>
							time{" "}
						</a>
						I also share my own adventures.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>
